    LLM: "Focus on creating your first burraco quickly. Use jokers and twos wisely to complete difficult melds. Take pozzetto when you have a strong position. Watch partner's melds to coordinate.\n\nTrack which cards have been played and discarded. Time your pozzetto take carefully - direct take lets you use cards immediately; indirect hides your new hand. Balance clean vs dirty burracos based on game state.\n\nCalculate optimal discard pile takes based on visible cards. Force opponents into difficult positions by holding key cards. Use the discard pile to manipulate what opponents can take. Advanced card counting to predict opponent hands.",
